  "description": "Targeting HUD with rolling-shutter scan skew \u2014 each row is exposed at its own instant, so the readout shears with motion the way the CMOS sensor it imitates actually does \u2014 and per-band telemetry rings: eight concentric arcs around the reticle, one per FFT bin, each sweeping at its own rate with arc length reporting its level. Adds click target-lock pings, phosphor persistence and a corrected A/B packing (display in A, masks in B).",
